            "$type": "typography",
            "$description": "The value — typed or chosen — the placeholder, the prefix and the suffix. 16 px at medium and large, so that a touch browser does not zoom into a box a person types in; small is body text one step down, the size of the labels of the buttons a small box stands beside.",
